{"schema":"hsr-dialogue.v1","entryId":"divergent-universe","chapterId":"event-tourn-113","referenceCommit":"312b4597691e0a29cf9828a15b592757dba86949","textReferenceCommit":"312b4597691e0a29cf9828a15b592757dba86949","sourceIds":["event-tourn-113"],"missing":0,"rows":[{"id":"divergent-universe-event-tourn-113-talk-403816220-line","entryId":"divergent-universe","chapterId":"event-tourn-113","missionId":"event-tourn-113","mission":"선택 곤란 (1)","scene":"선택 곤란 (1)","type":"dialogue","speaker":"시뮬레이션 우주","text":"당신은 숨을 헐떡이며 알다 별 모텔에 들어섰다. 왠지는 잘 모르겠지만 여기 사람들은 일할 때 느릿느릿하고 정신이 딴 데 팔려있다","talkId":403816220,"textHash":"12560568085925050221","source":"tournHandBookEvent:113/talk-403816220","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"2e9098e37e5a5d7f","bwikiNextIds":["divergent-universe-event-tourn-113-talk-403816221-line"],"bwikiPage":"选择困难（其一）","bwikiRevision":96782,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-13819","bwikiMission":"선택 곤란 (1)"},{"id":"divergent-universe-event-tourn-113-talk-403816221-line","entryId":"divergent-universe","chapterId":"event-tourn-113","missionId":"event-tourn-113","mission":"선택 곤란 (1)","scene":"선택 곤란 (1)","type":"dialogue","speaker":"시뮬레이션 우주","text":"장시간의 정박 등록은 당신의 인내심을 닳게 했고, 외성 세균 소독은 당신을 장장 20 표준 시간의 공복 상태에 빠뜨렸다","talkId":403816221,"textHash":"8389933746319102912","source":"tournHandBookEvent:113/talk-403816221","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"2e9098e37e5a5d7f","bwikiNextIds":["divergent-universe-event-tourn-113-talk-403816222-line"],"bwikiPage":"选择困难（其一）","bwikiRevision":96782,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-13819","bwikiMission":"선택 곤란 (1)"},{"id":"divergent-universe-event-tourn-113-talk-403816222-line","entryId":"divergent-universe","chapterId":"event-tourn-113","missionId":"event-tourn-113","mission":"선택 곤란 (1)","scene":"선택 곤란 (1)","type":"dialogue","speaker":"시뮬레이션 우주","text":"당신은 부푼 기대를 안고 음식주문앱을 켰다. 하지만 이 망할 선택곤란증은 눈이 핑핑 돌아갈 정도로 다양한 메뉴를 보고 당신의 사고를 앗아갔다. 가뜩이나 지쳐있던 뇌가 새하얗게 물들었다","talkId":403816222,"textHash":"1775853595325133906","source":"tournHandBookEvent:113/talk-403816222","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"2e9098e37e5a5d7f","bwikiNextIds":["divergent-universe-event-tourn-113-talk-403816223-line"],"bwikiPage":"选择困难（其一）","bwikiRevision":96782,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-13819","bwikiMission":"선택 곤란 (1)"},{"id":"divergent-universe-event-tourn-113-talk-403816223-line","entryId":"divergent-universe","chapterId":"event-tourn-113","missionId":"event-tourn-113","mission":"선택 곤란 (1)","scene":"선택 곤란 (1)","type":"dialogue","speaker":"시뮬레이션 우주","text":"당신은 곧 은하 역사상 두 번째로 풀 수 없는 철학적 난제와 마주했다는 것을 깨달았다——오늘 뭐 먹지","talkId":403816223,"textHash":"4440645107678440629","source":"tournHandBookEvent:113/talk-403816223","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"2e9098e37e5a5d7f","bwikiNextIds":[],"bwikiPage":"选择困难（其一）","bwikiRevision":96782,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-13819","bwikiMission":"선택 곤란 (1)"},{"id":"divergent-universe-event-tourn-113-text-1741753553382803372-choice","entryId":"divergent-universe","chapterId":"event-tourn-113","missionId":"event-tourn-113","mission":"선택 곤란 (1)","scene":"선택 곤란 (1)","type":"choice","speaker":"","text":"선주 콜라보 세트","talkId":null,"textHash":"1741753553382803372","source":"tournHandBookEvent:113/text-1741753553382803372","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"0ceb4140ca3bbe9f","bwikiNextIds":[],"bwikiPage":"选择困难（其一）","bwikiRevision":96782,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-13819","bwikiMission":"선택 곤란 (1)"},{"id":"divergent-universe-event-tourn-113-talk-403816225-line","entryId":"divergent-universe","chapterId":"event-tourn-113","missionId":"event-tourn-113","mission":"선택 곤란 (1)","scene":"선택 곤란 (1)","type":"dialogue","speaker":"시뮬레이션 우주","text":"결정을 내릴 수 없다면 가장 익숙한 걸 선택하자","talkId":403816225,"textHash":"329373106046365113","source":"tournHandBookEvent:113/talk-403816225","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"7c59918d20fd4dc8","bwikiNextIds":[],"bwikiPage":"选择困难（其一）","bwikiRevision":96782,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-13819","bwikiMission":"선택 곤란 (1)"},{"id":"divergent-universe-event-tourn-113-text-1142634870836499442-choice","entryId":"divergent-universe","chapterId":"event-tourn-113","missionId":"event-tourn-113","mission":"선택 곤란 (1)","scene":"선택 곤란 (1)","type":"choice","speaker":"","text":"공포새 과일찜","talkId":null,"textHash":"1142634870836499442","source":"tournHandBookEvent:113/text-1142634870836499442","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"62a691314bcf95a9","bwikiNextIds":[],"bwikiPage":"选择困难（其一）","bwikiRevision":96782,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-13819","bwikiMission":"선택 곤란 (1)"},{"id":"divergent-universe-event-tourn-113-talk-403816227-line","entryId":"divergent-universe","chapterId":"event-tourn-113","missionId":"event-tourn-113","mission":"선택 곤란 (1)","scene":"선택 곤란 (1)","type":"dialogue","speaker":"시뮬레이션 우주","text":"자포자기, 가장 이상한 걸 선택했다","talkId":403816227,"textHash":"15638442882977468677","source":"tournHandBookEvent:113/talk-403816227","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"4a49def972460878","bwikiNextIds":[],"bwikiPage":"选择困难（其一）","bwikiRevision":96782,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-13819","bwikiMission":"선택 곤란 (1)"},{"id":"divergent-universe-event-tourn-113-text-1876242551684147224-choice","entryId":"divergent-universe","chapterId":"event-tourn-113","missionId":"event-tourn-113","mission":"선택 곤란 (1)","scene":"선택 곤란 (1)","type":"choice","speaker":"","text":"빅데이터가 답을 줄 것이다","talkId":null,"textHash":"1876242551684147224","source":"tournHandBookEvent:113/text-1876242551684147224","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"6910b232e6080637","bwikiNextIds":["divergent-universe-event-tourn-113-text-5947784862945263009-effect"],"bwikiPage":"选择困难（其一）","bwikiRevision":96782,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-13819","bwikiMission":"선택 곤란 (1)"},{"id":"divergent-universe-event-tourn-113-text-5947784862945263009-effect","entryId":"divergent-universe","chapterId":"event-tourn-113","missionId":"event-tourn-113","mission":"선택 곤란 (1)","scene":"선택 곤란 (1)","type":"narration","speaker":"","text":"다음에 더 정확한 메뉴 추천을 받게 된다","talkId":null,"textHash":"5947784862945263009","source":"tournHandBookEvent:113/text-5947784862945263009","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"6910b232e6080637","bwikiNextIds":[],"bwikiPage":"选择困难（其一）","bwikiRevision":96782,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-13819","bwikiMission":"선택 곤란 (1)","bwikiReplyToIds":["divergent-universe-event-tourn-113-text-1876242551684147224-choice"]},{"id":"divergent-universe-event-tourn-113-talk-403816231-line","entryId":"divergent-universe","chapterId":"event-tourn-113","missionId":"event-tourn-113","mission":"선택 곤란 (1)","scene":"선택 곤란 (1)","type":"dialogue","speaker":"시뮬레이션 우주","text":"당신의 문화적 배경과 생물적 특징을 고려하여 앱에서 십여 가지 추천 세트를 골라줬지만, 당신은 여전히 결론을 내리지 못했다. 앱이 계속 추천 내용을 갱신하지만 어떤 건 너무 기름지고 어떤 건 너무 담백하다","talkId":403816231,"textHash":"5750381020580920274","source":"tournHandBookEvent:113/talk-403816231","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"d094db828e1a20a1","bwikiNextIds":["divergent-universe-event-tourn-113-talk-403816232-line"],"bwikiPage":"选择困难（其一）","bwikiRevision":96782,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-13819","bwikiMission":"선택 곤란 (1)"},{"id":"divergent-universe-event-tourn-113-talk-403816232-line","entryId":"divergent-universe","chapterId":"event-tourn-113","missionId":"event-tourn-113","mission":"선택 곤란 (1)","scene":"선택 곤란 (1)","type":"dialogue","speaker":"시뮬레이션 우주","text":"앱이 물었다. 특별히 먹고 싶은 게 있냐고. 당신은 말했다——아무거나","talkId":403816232,"textHash":"18057971391497396435","source":"tournHandBookEvent:113/talk-403816232","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"d094db828e1a20a1","bwikiNextIds":["divergent-universe-event-tourn-113-talk-403816233-line"],"bwikiPage":"选择困难（其一）","bwikiRevision":96782,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-13819","bwikiMission":"선택 곤란 (1)"},{"id":"divergent-universe-event-tourn-113-talk-403816233-line","entryId":"divergent-universe","chapterId":"event-tourn-113","missionId":"event-tourn-113","mission":"선택 곤란 (1)","scene":"선택 곤란 (1)","type":"dialogue","speaker":"시뮬레이션 우주","text":"「저는 쓸모없는 쓰레기 앱이에요. 더 좋은 앱을 찾아주세요」 앱은 당신에게 다른 앱도 추천해주고 밥값도 줬다","talkId":403816233,"textHash":"6129406784610565580","source":"tournHandBookEvent:113/talk-403816233","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"d094db828e1a20a1","bwikiNextIds":[],"bwikiPage":"选择困难（其一）","bwikiRevision":96782,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-13819","bwikiMission":"선택 곤란 (1)"},{"id":"divergent-universe-event-tourn-113-text-13549883901650631563-choice","entryId":"divergent-universe","chapterId":"event-tourn-113","missionId":"event-tourn-113","mission":"선택 곤란 (1)","scene":"선택 곤란 (1)","type":"choice","speaker":"","text":"오, 이득이네","talkId":null,"textHash":"13549883901650631563","source":"tournHandBookEvent:113/text-13549883901650631563","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"8bba748c7871e9ed","bwikiNextIds":[],"bwikiPage":"选择困难（其一）","bwikiRevision":96782,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-13819","bwikiMission":"선택 곤란 (1)"},{"id":"divergent-universe-event-tourn-113-talk-403816229-line","entryId":"divergent-universe","chapterId":"event-tourn-113","missionId":"event-tourn-113","mission":"선택 곤란 (1)","scene":"선택 곤란 (1)","type":"dialogue","speaker":"시뮬레이션 우주","text":"배에서 더 큰 소리가 난다","talkId":403816229,"textHash":"15647204122442749693","source":"tournHandBookEvent:113/talk-403816229","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"211b3ec6921836b5","bwikiNextIds":[],"bwikiPage":"选择困难（其一）","bwikiRevision":96782,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-13819","bwikiMission":"선택 곤란 (1)"}],"orderNote":"공식 사건 도감에 귀속된 한국어 원문입니다. BWIKI에서 확인한 모드별 구간만 연결하며 조건·확률·미확인 경계는 이어 붙이지 않습니다.","bwikiBaseOrder":["divergent-universe-event-tourn-113-talk-403816220-line","divergent-universe-event-tourn-113-talk-403816221-line","divergent-universe-event-tourn-113-talk-403816222-line","divergent-universe-event-tourn-113-talk-403816223-line","divergent-universe-event-tourn-113-tex